CLASS net/minecraft/world/entity/Entity
	FIELD TAG_ID Ljava/lang/String;
		COMMENT Auxiliary constants used to determine Stringification of components.
		COMMENT @see ValueOutput
	FIELD uuid Ljava/util/UUID;
		COMMENT A [`UUID`][java.util.UUID] used to distinguish between different instances of Entity.
	METHOD addTag (Ljava/lang/String;)Z
		COMMENT Adds a tag to this Entity.
		COMMENT @see net.minecraft.server.commands.TagCommand `TagCommand`
	METHOD discard ()V
		COMMENT Removes this Entity from the [`Level`][net.minecraft.world.level.Level] it is in. The Entity ceases all interactions with the rest of the Level and is not saved to Level data.
	METHOD entityTags ()Ljava/util/Set;
		COMMENT Returns this Entity's tags.
		COMMENT @see net.minecraft.server.commands.TagCommand `TagCommand`
	METHOD getTeamColor ()I
		COMMENT Returns the color associated with the [`Team`][net.minecraft.world.scores.Team] this Entity is part of as an RGB `int`.
		COMMENT @return the color associated with the [`Team`][net.minecraft.world.scores.Team] this Entity is part of as an RGB `int` or `0xFFFFFF` if the Entity is not part of a Team or the Team has no color
	METHOD isSpectator ()Z
		COMMENT Returns whether the Entity is an instance of [`Player`][net.minecraft.world.entity.player.Player] whose [`GameType`][net.minecraft.world.level.GameType] is set to [`GameType#SPECTATOR`][net.minecraft.world.level.GameType#SPECTATOR].
		COMMENT @see [`Player#gameMode()`][net.minecraft.world.entity.player.Player#gameMode()]
	METHOD kill (Lnet/minecraft/server/level/ServerLevel;)V
		COMMENT Kills this Entity.
		COMMENT This removes this Entity from the [`Level`][net.minecraft.world.level.Level] it is in.
		COMMENT The Entity ceases all interactions with the rest of the Level and is not saved to Level data.
		COMMENT
		COMMENT Additionally, the [`GameEvent`][net.minecraft.world.level.gameevent.GameEvent] [`GameEvent#ENTITY_DIE`][net.minecraft.world.level.gameevent.GameEvent#ENTITY_DIE] is broadcast.
	METHOD removeTag (Ljava/lang/String;)Z
		COMMENT Removes a tag from this Entity.
		COMMENT @see net.minecraft.server.commands.TagCommand `TagCommand`
	CLASS RemovalReason
		COMMENT Reasons an [`Entity`][net.minecraft.world.entity.Entity] is removed from a [`Level`][net.minecraft.world.level.Level]
